{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Shiguang Live 將影片創作與桌布瀏覽整合於同一介面，既可把喜歡的影片片段製作成 Live Photo，也可瀏覽精選桌布為手機換上合適畫面。適合喜歡自製動態相片、又想快速整理螢幕桌布的使用者。此 App 原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-25.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>影片轉換與桌布瀏覽</h2>\n<p>匯入影片後可挑選片段、設定封面並調整構圖，儲存為 Live Photo，亦可匯入既有 Live Photo；未完成的編輯會保留為草稿。桌布圖庫可按分類、關鍵字或顏色瀏覽，提供直向、鎖定畫面及主畫面預覽，方便確認時鐘與圖示效果，並可書籤收藏或儲存至相片圖書館。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-29-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-30-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-31-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-32-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Shiguang Live: Wallpaper Maker</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/shiguang-live-wallpaper-maker/id6817627056?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:40:45.378120+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:17:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:59:07.281960+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:15.161319+00:00","content_hash":"84db82d67a4d27ab2c9a48553715b2b79290338fdf5d745acefec51ee81aaa43","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}